s Codex, DeepSeek, and WorkBuddy, so you can generate classrooms from messaging apps like…"],"features":["One-click lesson generation — Describe a topic or attach your materials; the AI builds a full lesson in minutes","Multi-agent classroom — AI teachers and peers lecture, discuss, and interact with you in real time","Rich scene types — Slides, quizzes, interactive HTML simulations, and project-based learning (PBL)","Whiteboard & TTS — Agents draw diagrams, write formulas, and explain out loud","Export anywhere — Download editable .pptx slides or interactive .html pages"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6d2505e0a6c6b32219cbd7ccf108c655f6e4bc91ff4a3edc83ae96fe60d9ee9b","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:25.560Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:25.560Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T16:07:19Z","previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:32:26.566Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://open.maic.chat/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-05T19:32:26.566Z","status":"working","nextCheckAt":"2026-10-12T19:32:26.566Z","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:32:26.566Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-05T19:32:26.566Z","target":"https://open.maic.chat/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"probeVersion":3},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Get an immersive, multi-agent learning experience in just one click","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The copied example needs only OPENAIAPIKEY in .env.local (or change its provider to one you have a key for); everything else in it is commented out until you want it. openmaic.yml declares providers (accounts the server can call) and gives each slot (a use of AI: the outline, slide content, text to speech, web search, …) a model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/THU-MAIC/OpenMAIC/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Vercel builds its default branch; c